# Unit tests for alarm.c (run: make && python3 run_vectors.py tests.vec).
# Each block states the rule it pins down; see the header comment of alarm.c.

### limits-are-strict limits
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=600
init 0
s 1 30
s 2 10
s 3 30.001
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@3:30.001

### delay-zero-is-immediate limits delay
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=600
