### late-sample-settles-due-transition-first delay tick
# The last sample is held until the next one: a late sample first settles what
# was already due (TO_HIGH with the held 35), then applies its own value.
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=600
init 0
s 20 35
s 50 25
s 79 25
s 80 25
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@50:35.000
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@80:25.000

