s 0 20
sf 5 20
sf 6 21
s 7 nan
s 8 inf
s 9 22
s 10 nan
s 11 -inf
s 12 22
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@5:20.000
FAULT
FAULT
FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@9:22.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@10:nan
FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@12:22.000

