### escalation-counts-from-announcement-not-from-due-time escalation tick
# TO_HIGH fell due at 30 but was only announced at 500 (no call in between);
# the operator gets the full escalate_after_s from 500.
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=100
init 0
s 0 35
tick 500
tick 599
tick 600
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@500:35.000
HIGH
HIGH ESCALATE@600:35.000
